<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine June consumer price inflation by sector.</title>
<headline>Argentine June consumer price inflation by sector.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentine consumer price inflation by sector was as follows in June, the Economy Ministry said:</p>
<p>    Food				     0.6</p>
<p>    Clothing				-0.2</p>
<p>    Housing				 -0.1</p>
<p>    Household goods		     -0.1</p>
<p>    Health				   0.4</p>
<p>    Transport and communications     0.1</p>
<p>    Entertainment			 -0.2</p>
<p>    Education				0.0</p>
<p>    Others				  -0.1</p>
<p>    Total				    0.2</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
